  "$comment": "The home gym and wellness at home (crates/art/things/src/fitness, built by cargo art). Listed in the base manifest's packs. The materials map onto the game's finishes so a model costs one draw call per finish group. The treadmill runs its belt (`belt_run`), the bike turns its pedals (`pedals_turn`) and the rowing machine strokes (`stroke`) while used; the yoga mat unrolls (`unroll`) for yoga; the sauna's glass door opens (`door_open`) to let the bathers in and out.",
